-&gt; conditional.\nSuppose to avoid CTA to-store issues, comment: ... Q&amp;A prepared:\nQ: \"这碗肉看着油亮，是加了什么？\" A: \"油亮是收汁收出来的。糖色和自家糟卤一起收，不收干，收到刚好挂住肉。\" This asserts technique &amp; partly claim. Wait factual basis? user said sauce base of自家糟卤, process not specific; don't invent cooking tech claim (\"糖色\" maybe no evidence). Need to avoid fabrication. Better preanswer doesn't invent detailed steps:\nQ: \"这个颜色是炒糖色吗/怎么做的？\" A: \"做法里能公开讲的就是：自家腌的黄酒糟卤打底。剩下的火候，你来店里吃一次比我说十句管用。\" Hmm \"来店里吃\" = to-store CTA, not authorized. -&gt; then only \"做法是店里每天重复做的事，一两句说不清；能说的我会在这条评论区里答。\" honest but no info hmm lacking new info.\nComment preanswers should provide value: Q: 糟卤是买还是自己做的？A: \"自己腌的。黄酒糟卤是这锅肉的底味，12年没换过方子。\" Wait \"没换过方子\" not asked? assert as if \"配方不变\" claim invented from 12year? Better: \"自己腌的，闻着有酒香，吃到嘴里是肉香。\" sensory; based on owner's use. okay.\n\nTwo Q&amp;A:\n1) Q 糟卤是店里自己做的吗? A: 自己腌的。这锅肉的味道就是从这一勺糟卤来的。（事实F4）\n2) Q 肉每天是现烧吗? A user never asserted every day fresh cooked?? \"出锅过程\" daily. Say \"每天要出的就是这一锅，卖完收摊。\" Wait claims数量one pot? Not factual; no.\n2') Q 卖了多少年? A: 今年第12年。对店里的师傅来说，它就是每天最日常的一锅。(fact F3)\n3) Honest fallback: 若被问“具体菜谱/配方” → A: \"具体比例是店里的手艺，但这道菜的做法全在这条街能吃到——不用配方也能吃。\" no. Actually user didn't say recipe secret. So don't invent boundaries. Should we prepare real boundary: Ask \"是不是预制菜？\" (perception concern) factual: \"肉是每天本地菜场买的五花肉，检验合格证我们贴在店里。\" This is allowed fact (F6)\ngreat.\n\nCaptions rules: 单屏10多字? not verified — set qualitative: 每屏≤一个意群; 首屏完整; 关键词可单独一屏; 字放画面中部偏上（避开上下被平台遮挡区：上部安全约≥150px、下方约300px）;字幕不遮肉/勺/蒸汽；断句按呼吸. And in platform variant for Douyin available page. Actually captions with the app post editor could use automatic; still.\n\nSound: no director pack/mix, no known music: propose keep natural (sizzling、勺子碰锅、蒸汽), voice maybe absent; place no music until editing; if adding music choose one that does not cover the \"浇汁\" sound; end at the last plate landing. Draft placeholder pending actual footage &amp; any rights. Since footages user shot may