orize经营 &amp; if yes need store name/road/POI或美团 page; maybe quality certs etc not needed in packaging.\n\nAlso route packaging route count exactly 2 vs \"包装候选数量 by real tradeoff—存在真实取舍\": write only routes considering candidate possible.\n\nPotential risk: user said \"想让观众知道…不是随便炒的\" - Claims phrase could appear in copy:\n\"这锅肉不是什么祖传秘方，也不是机器出来的——它就是一口锅、一个人、12年。\" hmm phrase nice and honest; or \"没有祖传，没有秘方，就是每天一锅红烧肉，做了12年。\" Actually the user's non-promise can be turned into distinctive statement. But \"机器出来\" weird: no concept. Use \"没有祖传三代的说法，我们家就开了12年——但这12年里，这锅肉天天这么做。\"\nCareful \"天天\" = every day, unsupported? Restaurant likely opens daily; yet \"天天\" implies every calendar day incl closures. Revise: \"卖了12年，做法就是这么个做法——自家腌糟卤、本地五花肉、一锅一锅收汁。\" Wait \"一锅一锅收汁\" harmless—they are a store making per batch. Present facts \"自家糟卤/本地五花\": legitimate based on F4/F6. Sweet.\n\nPublish copy final:\nLine1: 老城区一条巷子里，8张桌。\nLine2: 菜单上最老的一道：红烧肉，卖了12年。\nLine3: 自家腌的黄酒糟卤打底，肉是每天本地菜场买的五花。\nLine4-6: \"这40秒是它出锅的样子。油亮、挂汁、冒热气。没有祖传秘方，也没必要有——一锅肉认真做12年，本身就是说法。\"\nLine7 closing question.\nHmm \"肉是每天本地菜场买的五花\"—if actual footage doesn't show, in copy no issue; but claim daily local 菜场: F6 says \"红烧肉用的五花肉是本地菜场买的\" not explicitly \"每天\", revise to \"本地菜场买的五花肉\".\nLine3: \"五花肉是本地菜场买的，黄酒糟卤是自己腌的。\"\n\nRemove “12年认真做” claim? 认真 subjective but acceptable? hmm PP's 4 \"好吃\" etc; \"认真\" not factual claim? characterization grounded via stable day. fine.\n\nComment first item say something about 做法?\n\nAlso no reward interactions.\n\nNow the top item in user delivery is conclusion short then formats:\nstatus NEEDS_DECISION.\n\"现在是草案，别直接照发\"? Wait almost all copy can be published today? Only needs actual title selection etc. But by process, not ready. Natural language: \"这版先别直接发——不是内容不行，是三个决定需要你拍板，拍完我再出可发布的最终一版。\" Good.\n\nAlso include \"没把你的到店/储值卡话术写进去\" as decision natural.\n\nCareful user delivery no wording \"未核实/不得使用\" etc. Avoid \"禁止\"/removed. Simply positive \"这一版先做到关注/评论引导，不硬推门店与办卡。你确认要加'来店/储值卡'的话