e options (master list):\n\nEntry types: situation etc...\n\n- Candidate SJ (SITUATION): 「老城区这条巷子里，红烧肉刚出锅」 — Cover claims? This means as location descriptor is enough. Length 17 &gt;15. try \"巷口的红烧肉，刚出锅\"(12) but they aren't at巷口? Avoid modifying. \n- \"第12年，还是这锅肉\"(~10)。 strong.\n- ...\nSet per-route maybe each with 2-3 type.\n\nRoute A final titles:\nA1 (SITUATION): 「红烧肉出锅那40秒」(10)\nA2 (CONTRADICTION): 「一滴油没加，亮的却是这锅肉」 wait that's claim — no, false? no idea. skip contradiction.\nA3 (QUOTABLE...) no...\n\nRoute B Best candidates:\nB1「这锅肉，在这条巷子里卖了12年」(approx14)\nB2「第12年，这锅肉还是当天现烧」? hmm approx 13.\nB3「店才12年，但这锅肉没断过一天」(15)?\nInfo word: Check count: 店才12年，但这锅肉没断过一天 = 店才(2)+12年(3)＋，但这锅肉没断过一天 (10) =14-15 — accept as 建议≤15. \"没断过一天\" implies each day since 12yrs, supported by owner? YES: if a small store open every day? A restaurant may have rest days, 没断过一天 claim is dangerous - not stated by owner! Only says \"已经卖了十二年了\" don't claim every day without break unless authorized. Fix: 「第12年，这锅肉还在按老做法烧」(14) conveys craft, no daily claim. or \"同一锅红烧肉，做了12年\" wrong since no single pot.\nRecommended (overall): B1 as main, alternative \"第12年，做法还是当初那个做法\" perhaps if the footage includes fire/wok/stew? Strong.\n\nWait style options: User wants \"old craft, not casually made\". The most precise words: \"12年，就为了把这一碗做明白\"? Hmm. \"做明白\" implies currently achieved — not exact claims.\nLet's settle: \ntitle candidates to present:\n1. SITUATION(情境)「红烧肉出锅，最后这40秒」 — has direct\"最后40秒\" video-reliant; on Douyin caption summary? The actual footage may not actually literally be 40s if app length etc; but title says约40? Maybe just \"出锅那40秒\" ok.\n2. INFORMATION(信息)「想知道这锅肉为什么不一样，看这勺汁」 — gap: viewer doesn't know yet; the footage promises reveal once they see ladle? But if the actual shot just pouring without explicit reason, user does not know \"为什么\"—cheat. no. Adjust: \"红烧肉出锅前，这勺汁是最后一道关\" as situation/ craft info; is cook/commentary creative claim, maybe acceptable aesthetic? Yet we don't know.\n