rt as if \"配方不变\" claim invented from 12year? Better: \"自己腌的，闻着有酒香，吃到嘴里是肉香。\" sensory; based on owner's use. okay.\n\nTwo Q&amp;A:\n1) Q 糟卤是店里自己做的吗? A: 自己腌的。这锅肉的味道就是从这一勺糟卤来的。（事实F4）\n2) Q 肉每天是现烧吗? A user never asserted every day fresh cooked?? \"出锅过程\" daily. Say \"每天要出的就是这一锅，卖完收摊。\" Wait claims数量one pot? Not factual; no.\n2') Q 卖了多少年? A: 今年第12年。对店里的师傅来说，它就是每天最日常的一锅。(fact F3)\n3) Honest fallback: 若被问“具体菜谱/配方” → A: \"具体比例是店里的手艺，但这道菜的做法全在这条街能吃到——不用配方也能吃。\" no. Actually user didn't say recipe secret. So don't invent boundaries. Should we prepare real boundary: Ask \"是不是预制菜？\" (perception concern) factual: \"肉是每天本地菜场买的五花肉，检验合格证我们贴在店里。\" This is allowed fact (F6)\ngreat.\n\nCaptions rules: 单屏10多字? not verified — set qualitative: 每屏≤一个意群; 首屏完整; 关键词可单独一屏; 字放画面中部偏上（避开上下被平台遮挡区：上部安全约≥150px、下方约300px）;字幕不遮肉/勺/蒸汽；断句按呼吸. And in platform variant for Douyin available page. Actually captions with the app post editor could use automatic; still.\n\nSound: no director pack/mix, no known music: propose keep natural (sizzling、勺子碰锅、蒸汽), voice maybe absent; place no music until editing; if adding music choose one that does not cover the \"浇汁\" sound; end at the last plate landing. Draft placeholder pending actual footage &amp; any rights. Since footages user shot may have little/harsh sounds.\n\nNow platform variants: Douyin specifics:\n- adaptation modifications are listed:\n1. 标题文案: at the beginning used? Douyin feed: title displayed under? First display: 底部第一行 alongside? Actually on Douyin, first frame shown; title provided as few words visibility. 刷到型: 首帧和开头1秒必须…\n2. 首帧: auto-selected? upload video cover set. Note openplatform style watermark not relevant.\n3. 标题≤15字from ref.\n4. 单屏字幕 unverified -&gt; qualitative.\n5. hashtags Not applicable etc.\n\nRelease check result as \"五条结论\" for draft; specify cannot execute (footage absent), but provides checklist + how this package would pass/fail:\n\n1. 静音播放: will be checked by the user; all we promised that scene alone enough (首帧/字幕 leads) … 